 R←Test_40(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;H;state;count;full;fulls;signature;ceiling;resetAfter;i
⍝ `StormRule`: one recurring error gets the full treatment at its 1st, 2nd, 4th, 8th and 16th occurrence only
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 H←##.HandleError
 state←H.NewStormState
 signature←'11 Foo[6]'
 ceiling←100
 resetAfter←24
 fulls←⍬
 :For i :In ⍳20
     (state count full)←H.StormRule state signature(1000000+i)ceiling resetAfter
     fulls,←full
 :EndFor

 →T.GoToTidyUp fulls≢(⍳20)∊1 2 4 8 16
 →T.GoToTidyUp 20≢count
 →T.GoToTidyUp(,⊂signature)≢state.signatures
 →T.GoToTidyUp(,16)≢state.lastFulls
 →T.GoToTidyUp 5≢≢state.fulls
 →T.GoToTidyUp(,1000001)≢state.firsts
 →T.GoToTidyUp(,1000020)≢state.lasts

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
